    <p class="section-sub">If you have any queries, or require any further information, please do not hesitate to contact me. I will respond to all requests within 48 hours.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-card reveal">
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:umartnba.1992@gmail.com">umartnba.1992@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href="tel:+447961667042">+447 9616 6704</a></p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px;color:var(--ink-2)">Preferred response via email. Please include your child's exam board and current year group if known.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-card reveal">
      <form action="https://formsubmit.co/umartnba.1992@gmail.com" method="POST">
        <div style="display:grid;gap:12px">
          <label>First name <input type="text" name="first_name" required></label>
          <label>Last name <input type="text" name="last_name" required></label>
          <label>Email <input type="email" name="email" required></label>
          <label>Message <textarea name="message" required></textarea></label>
          <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><input type="checkbox" name="newsletter"> <span style="font-weight:400">Sign up for news and updates</span></label>
        </div>
